This product bundles no third-party code. Every format reader here is written from
the published specification rather than ported from an existing implementation:

  * ISO 9660          ECMA-119
  * Joliet            Microsoft's Joliet specification (UCS-2 supplementary volume)
  * Rock Ridge / SUSP IEEE P1282 and IEEE P1281
  * UDF               ECMA-167, and the OSTA UDF specification
  * El Torito         the "El Torito" Bootable CD-ROM Format Specification

Tools/pc-universal.sh is taken from the Peach Commander repository
(https://github.com/hkiam/PeachCommander), under the same licence.

The test fixtures under Tests/ISOPluginTests/Fixtures/ are disc images generated by
macOS's own hdiutil from the throwaway tree in Tools/make-fixtures.sh. They contain
no third-party content; Tests/ISOPluginTests/Fixtures/manifest.txt records the exact
command that produced each one.
